# 第三方下载（Unity iOS 运行时），由 scripts/fetch_unity_ios.sh 生成；不能进仓库
# Third-party downloads (the Unity iOS runtime), created by scripts/fetch_unity_ios.sh; must never be committed
/vendor/

# 全部构建产物：改标后的二进制、转换后的游戏数据、生成的 Xcode 工程、日志与截图
# All build output: retagged binaries, converted game data, the generated Xcode project, logs and snapshots
/build/

# 本机配置（团队 ID、Bundle ID、设备）
# Local configuration (Team ID, bundle ID, device)
/config.env

# 任何游戏内容都不进仓库（多一道保险）
# No game content ever enters the repository (an extra safeguard)
*.assets
*.resS
*.resource
*.bundle
*.vtc
*.vtc2
*.ips
*.jpg
global-metadata.dat
GameAssembly*
UnityPlayer*
libiPhone-lib*

.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
xcuserdata/
DerivedData/
